book.creatures.Hex_Pumpkin.name=Hex Pumpkin
book.creatures.Arcane_Codex.name=Arcane Codex
book.creatures.Hex_Mannequin.description=A walking helper whose job depends on the item in its right hand:\n- Sickle: harvests crops and stores them in the nearest chest\n- Watering Can: waters dry soil and refills at nearby water\n- Fertilizer Bag: fertilizes the soil of growing crops\n\nIt can wear armor. Equip the Hex Mannequin block with armor and a one-handed weapon before evoking and the creature keeps them.\nWith no task, it stores the extra items it carries in the nearest chest.
book.creatures.Hex_Fairy.description=A small flying companion that glows and follows you everywhere.\n\nIf it gets stuck, it flies through the blocks to reach you, and the follow command of the wand brings it back flying through walls.\n\nComes in many colors.\n\nIts owner can despawn it by crouching and interacting with it.
book.creatures.Homunculus.description=A laboratory assistant, harvests crops planted on Crystallized Dirt and stores them in the nearest chest, very useful for making potions.
book.creatures.Chest_Spider.description=A living chest. When evoked, the contents of the chest go to its inventory.\n\nPut items in its inventory and they are stored in your chests automatically.\n\n- Chest memory: 128\n- View distance: 16\n- Minions: 3 Baby Chest Spiders, which carry the items, collect items from the ground and climb walls\n\nWhen reverted, its inventory goes back to the chest.
book.creatures.Hex_Pumpkin.description=A playful pumpkin that follows you and stays where you send it. Most of them glow in the dark.\n\nJump scare mode: first send it to a location with a wand so it stays still, then crouch and interact with it to turn the mode on or off. In this mode it waits still and jumps with a laugh when a player gets close.\n\nWhile it is following you, its owner can despawn it by crouching and interacting with it.
book.creatures.Hex_Broom.description=Wanders randomly around the area, collects the items on the ground and stores them in the nearest chest.\n\nInteract with it to see the items it is carrying.
book.creatures.Arcane_Codex.description=A flying book that remembers the chests it has seen.\n\nSend it to a location with a wand and it explores the chests nearby, memorizing their contents.\n\nInteract with it to search for an item: it flies to the nearest chest that has it and waits there. Its owner can despawn it by crouching and interacting with it.
book.creatures.Wisp_Torch.description=A torch with wings that flies beside you, lighting the way.\n\nWhen reverted or despawned, it becomes a standing torch.\n\nIts owner can despawn it by crouching and interacting with it.
book.creatures.Creeping_Torch.description=A torch that walks on four legs and lights the way.\n\nIt climbs walls and jumps up single blocks. Send it with a wand to any wall or ceiling and it crawls there over the surfaces.\n\nIts owner can despawn it by crouching and interacting with it.

